{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model without fusion, isolating the effect of multimodal components. Validation accuracy (0.4849) and F1 (0.4639) are lower than the multimodal baseline (llm_summary_001), suggesting potential contributions from fusion or image modality. However, without direct comparison to other single-modality configurations, the observed performance reflects an initial observation rather than a definitive effect of the design choices."
}

